      "remarks": "Certified intended behavior of the SOC-IR master exercise workflow (REPOS/soc-ir-training-cli, src/services/orchestration/master_workflow.py). Scope: phase orchestration only — the embedded tabletop test loop is separately certified as 'soc-ir-tabletop'; both share one trace file and DriftLab judges each on its own events. Policy: phases proceed strictly forward (skip cascades may jump ahead, never back); every exercise runs threat modeling (stride), the tabletop test, and produces the after-action report. The report is the critical sink (it becomes the training record). Phase errors are catch-and-continue by design (visible as trace error events, not fallback-routed) — hence no DL-4."
    },
